    "body": "I think this is coming from default regexp behavior.  This:\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\n/(.*)/.exec('')[1]\r\n```\r\n\r\nEvaluates to the empty string.  I'll have to see what path-to-regexp is doing to get it to be undefined.",
