    "created_at": "2022-01-31T17:47:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-31T17:47:28Z",
    "body": "At least part of the problem here is urlpattern uses `record<USVString, USVString>` for the groups webidl which does not permit an undefined value.  This needs to change to `record<USVString, (USVString or undefined)>`.",
