    "updated_at": "2022-01-31T20:53:35Z",
    "body": "The other half of this is that chromium converts the null `WTF::String` internal type to empty string in its webidl bindings.   This means the spec is also not right because it does not do this auto-conversion, but also has webidl that says undefined should not be returned right now.\r\n\r\nSo I need to fix the implementation and the spec.",
